---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About D. Philhower Studio — a graphic design practice focused on custom brand creation and website design."
  path="/about"
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <p class="brand-line">D. Philhower Studio</p>
    <h1>A studio for brands that need to feel inevitable.</h1>
    <p>
      We design custom brand systems and websites for founders, teams, and organizations who want their
      presence to match their ambition.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="section prose-block reveal" aria-labelledby="story-title">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">The practice</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="story-title">Craft over clutter.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>
        D. Philhower Studio is an independent graphic design studio specializing in custom brand creation
        and website design. We work closely with clients to define a visual language that holds — across
        packaging, decks, social, and the site people land on when they search your name.
      </p>
      <p>
        The work is intentional and unhurried: strong type, considered color, and interfaces that make the
        brand feel complete the moment you arrive.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section reveal" aria-labelledby="values-title">
    <p class="section-label">How we show up</p>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="values-title">Principles that shape every engagement.</h2>
    <ul class="values">
      <li>
        <h3>Clarity first</h3>
        <p>If it doesn’t communicate, it doesn’t ship. Hierarchy and message lead every decision.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Systems, not one-offs</h3>
        <p>Logos and pages that scale — guidelines and components your team can actually use.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Presence over trend</h3>
        <p>We aim for work that still feels right in two years, not just this season’s look.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section reveal" aria-label="Studio facts">
    <ul class="stat-list">
      <li>
        <strong>Brand + web</strong>
        <span>Specialized focus so both sides of your presence speak the same language.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Direct collaboration</strong>
        <span>You work with the designer shaping the work — no account layers in between.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Hand-off ready</strong>
        <span>Assets, guidelines, and site builds documented for lasting ownership.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-strip reveal" aria-labelledby="about-cta">
    <div class="contact-strip-inner">
      <h2 id="about-cta">Let’s build something with weight.</h2>
      <p>Share a bit about your project and we’ll follow up with next steps.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Get in touch</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/work">See the work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
